Pick Up Notifier for Horizon
Copyright (c) 2026 its contributors.

A Rust port of Pick Up Notifier by Fuzs (heyitsfuzs),
https://github.com/Fuzss/pickupnotifier (branch 26.3.x, commit 4c828bd),
whose code is under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. This port is under the
same licence (LICENSE). The list's placement follows Puzzles Lib's
AnchorPoint, also by Fuzs (https://github.com/Fuzss/puzzleslib, MPL-2.0).
Thanks to TeamCoFH for the original idea (CoFH Core, Minecraft 1.6).

The original's assets (All Rights Reserved) are not used, its icon included.
The config screen (config.rs) follows the one the original shows on Fabric:
Puzzles Lib's FabricConfigurationScreen, also by Fuzs
(https://github.com/Fuzss/puzzleslib, MPL-2.0), over Forge Config API Port's
ConfigurationSectionScreen and ConfigurationListScreen
(https://github.com/Fuzss/forgeconfigapiport, from NeoForge's). The experience orb
and tooltip sprites are drawn from the player's own Minecraft resources.

Made for Horizon (https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon, MIT) with
horizon-mixins (https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon-mixins, MIT).
Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Synergies AB.
